    <item>
      <title>冰花煎餃 by 趙嘉貞 - 愛料理</title>
      <link>https://icook.tw/recipes/487952</link>
      <description>自己做「冰花煎餃」關鍵在於「麵粉水」與「不沾鍋」。無需退冰，將冷凍水餃排列於塗油的冷鍋，倒入「麵粉:水=1:10」的麵粉水至水餃約1/2高度，蓋鍋蓋以中大火煎煮約7-10分鐘至水收乾，轉小火煎至冰花焦黃，最後倒扣裝盤即可</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://icook.tw/recipes/487952</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://imgproxy.icook.network/safe/rs:fill:1200:0:0:0/q:80/plain/http://tokyo-kitchen.icook.tw.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/recipe/cover/487952/3d8eca25a6933a6f.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
